cursor-gateway is a Python port of cursor2api:
https://github.com/AstroQore/cursor2api

The protocol mapping, account format, fallback model catalogue and behavior were
adapted from AstroQore/cursor2api. The original project is licensed under
AGPL-3.0-only; that license is retained in LICENSE for this derivative work.

src/cursor_gateway/proto/agent.proto and value.proto are copied without changes
from cursor2api, which credits can1357/oh-my-pi's Cursor provider for agent.proto.
agent_pb2.py is generated by protoc from agent.proto.

This is an unofficial client and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Anysphere.
